msgstr "{\"left\", \"center\", \"right\"}，默认值为 \"left\""

#: forestploter.layout.ForestColumn:23 of
msgid "Horizontal alignment for the header and body cells."
msgstr "标题和正文单元格的水平对齐。"

#: forestploter.layout.ForestColumn:37 of
msgid ""
"Display fields may use supported vertical XLSX merges. A CI column is a "
"layout slot and does not need to be a physical file field; records target"
" it through ``_ci_column``. The sequence passed as ``columns`` is the "
"sole authority for final left-to-right order, so text columns can follow "
"CI columns even when the input-file fields are arranged differently."
msgstr ""
"显示字段可以使用受支持的XLSX 纵向合并。 CI 列是一个布局占位，不需要是文件中的实体字段；记录通过 ``_ci_column`` "
"来定位它。作为 ``columns`` 传递的序列是最终从左到右顺序的唯一权威，因此即使输入文件字段的排列方式不同，文本列也可以位于 CI "
"列之后。"

