#: forestploter.core.forest:94 of
msgid ""
"Prefer :func:`read_forest_data` for XLSX. For three series under one "
"outcome, the recommended hierarchy uses one ``header`` row for the shared"
" outcome-level values and three child ``_plot_row`` values with "
"``_indent=1``. Put the series label and its CI text on each child row. "
"This conventional layout needs no merged cells. Supported vertical XLSX "
"merges remain available for specialized display needs. On the header "
"record, leave ``_series``, ``_ci_column``, and ``estimate/lower/upper`` "
"blank; use ``_row_type=\"header\"``, ``_indent=0``, and "
"``_is_summary=False``."
msgstr "对于 XLSX，优先使用 :func:`read_forest_data`。当一个结局包含三个系列时，推荐使用一个 ``header`` 行保存共享的结局层级值，并为三个子行分别设置不同的 ``_plot_row`` 和 ``_indent=1``。在每个子行填写系列标签及其 CI 文本。这种常规布局不需要合并单元格；如有特殊显示需求，仍可使用受支持的 XLSX 纵向合并。标题记录中的 ``_series``、``_ci_column`` 和 ``estimate/lower/upper`` 应留空，并使用 ``_row_type=\"header\"``、``_indent=0`` 与 ``_is_summary=False``。"

#: forestploter.core.forest:103 of
msgid ""
"To show one series in several CI columns, duplicate the record, retain "
"the same ``_plot_row``, and change only ``_ci_column``. CSV uses the same"
" logical fields but has no merge metadata; blanks are never inferred or "
"forward-filled."
msgstr ""
"若要在多个 CI 列中显示同一系列，请复制该记录，保留相同的 ``_plot_row``，只修改 ``_ci_column``。CSV "
"使用相同的逻辑字段，但没有合并元数据；绝不会推断或向前填充空白值。"

#: forestploter.core.forest:108 of
msgid ""
"A readable file-header order is recommended but does not control output. "
"Place display fields before the first CI, then ``estimate/lower/upper`` "
"as the first CI's physical representation, then trailing display fields, "
"and finally the six controls ``_plot_row``, ``_series``, ``_ci_column``, "
"``_row_type``, ``_indent``, and ``_is_summary``. The ``columns`` sequence"
" remains authoritative for the actual rendered order."
msgstr ""
"推荐采用便于阅读的文件表头顺序，但它不控制输出。先放第一个 CI 之前的显示字段，再用 ``estimate/lower/upper`` "
"表示物理文件中的第一个 CI，随后放置 CI 后的显示字段，最后按顺序放置六个控制字段 "
"``_plot_row``、``_series``、``_ci_column``、``_row_type``、``_indent`` 和 "
"``_is_summary``。实际渲染顺序仍仅由 ``columns`` 决定。"

#: forestploter.core.forest:115 of
msgid ""
"``_row_type`` controls row semantics. ``_is_summary`` must be boolean and"
" controls marker shape only. A fully blank triple skips an interval; a "
"partially blank triple is invalid. At an axis overflow, an arrow replaces"
" the cap on that side. A fully off-scale interval shows only the nearest "
"outward arrow."
msgstr ""
"``_row_type`` 控制行语义。``_is_summary`` "
"必须是布尔值，且只控制标记形态。三元组全部留空时跳过该区间，部分留空则无效。区间越过坐标范围时，箭头取代相应一侧的竖向端帽；完全越界的区间只显示最近的向外箭头。"

#: forestploter.core.forest:121 of
msgid ""
"This function uses one global linear axis configuration. It performs no "
"logarithmic transformation and computes no effect size, confidence "
"interval, or meta-analysis statistic. ``ideal_line_columns`` controls "
"only the additional line's visibility; all CI columns still share the "
"same reference value, limits, and ticks."
msgstr ""
"本函数使用一套全局线性坐标配置，不执行对数变换，也不计算效应量、置信区间或荟萃分析统计量。``ideal_line_columns`` "
"只控制额外线是否可见；所有 CI 列仍共享同一参考值、范围和刻度。"

