#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:57 of
msgid ""
"Use a first worksheet named ``Forest`` and one row of unique field names."
" Two orders are deliberately independent:"
msgstr "请将第一个工作表命名为 ``Forest``，并使用一行不重复的字段名。以下两个顺序彼此独立："

#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:60 of
msgid ""
"The ``columns`` argument of :func:`forestploter.forest` is the only thing"
" that determines the final left-to-right plot order. Display columns may "
"appear before or after any CI column."
msgstr ""
":func:`forestploter.forest` 的 ``columns`` 参数是唯一决定最终从左到右绘图顺序的参数。显示列可以出现在任何"
" CI 列之前或之后。"

#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:63 of
msgid ""
"The XLSX/CSV header order exists for readable data entry and does not "
"determine plot order. A recommended file places display fields that "
"precede the first CI first, then ``estimate/lower/upper`` as the physical"
" representation of that CI, then trailing display fields, and finally the"
" six controls ``_plot_row``, ``_series``, ``_ci_column``, ``_row_type``, "
"``_indent``, and ``_is_summary``."
msgstr ""
"XLSX/CSV 表头顺序只用于提高录入可读性，并不决定绘图顺序。推荐先放第一个 CI 之前的显示字段，再以 "
"``estimate/lower/upper`` 作为该 CI 在物理文件中的表示，随后放置 CI 后的显示字段，最后按顺序放置六个控制字段 "
"``_plot_row``、``_series``、``_ci_column``、``_row_type``、``_indent`` 和 "
"``_is_summary``。"

#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:70 of
msgid ""
"Enter only one statistical triple per estimate record. For three series, "
"the recommended hierarchy uses one ``header`` record for the shared "
"outcome, sample size, and other group-level values, followed by three "
"series rows with distinct ``_plot_row`` values and ``_indent=1``. Put "
"each series label and CI text on its child row. This conventional layout "
"works identically in XLSX and CSV and requires no merged cells. Supported"
" vertical XLSX merges remain available when a centered multirow display "
"value is specifically desired. On the header record, leave ``_series``, "
"``_ci_column``, and ``estimate/lower/upper`` blank; use "
"``_row_type=\"header\"``, ``_indent=0``, and ``_is_summary=False``."
msgstr "每条估计记录只填写一组统计三元数。当有三个系列时，推荐使用一个 ``header`` 记录保存共享的结局、样本量和其他组层级值，随后为三个系列各设一行，使用不同的 ``_plot_row`` 且令 ``_indent=1``。在对应子行填写系列标签和 CI 文本。该常规布局在 XLSX 与 CSV 中结构完全相同，不需要合并单元格。仅当确实需要让一个显示值跨多行居中时，才使用受支持的 XLSX 纵向合并。标题记录中的 ``_series``、``_ci_column`` 和 ``estimate/lower/upper`` 应留空，并使用 ``_row_type=\"header\"``、``_indent=0`` 与 ``_is_summary=False``。"

#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:81 of
msgid ""
"To show the same series in two CI columns, duplicate its record, use a "
"different ``_ci_column``, and retain the same ``_plot_row``. The two "
"plotted intervals will share one y position."
msgstr ""
"若要在两个 CI 列中显示同一系列，请复制其记录，使用不同的 ``_ci_column``，并保留相同的 "
"``_plot_row``。两个绘制区间将共享同一个 y 位置。"

#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:85 of
msgid ""
"Merges are accepted only in display fields and must be single-column, "
"vertical ranges below the header. Merges in reserved fields, horizontal "
"or rectangular merges, and merges crossing the header are rejected. Blank"
" values are never forward-filled. All three of ``estimate/lower/upper`` "
"may be blank to skip an interval; a partially blank triple fails "
"validation in :func:`forestploter.forest`."
msgstr ""
"仅显示字段允许合并，且必须是表头下方、局限于单列的纵向区域。技术字段中的合并、横向或矩形合并以及跨越表头的合并都会被拒绝。空白值不会向前填充。 "
"``estimate/lower/upper`` 可以全部留空以跳过一个区间；三元组仅部分留空会在 "
":func:`forestploter.forest` 中验证失败。"

#: forestploter.data.read_forest_data:92 of
msgid ""
"The package does not evaluate Excel formulas. It uses cached results "
"saved in the workbook and asks the user to recalculate and save when a "
"required formula has no cache. CSV follows the same record and "
"``_plot_row`` rules, but cannot represent merges. Excel fonts, fills, "
"borders, row heights, and column widths do not override "
":class:`forestploter.ForestTheme` or :class:`forestploter.ForestColumn` "
"settings."
msgstr ""
