#: ../../data_contract.rst:396
msgid ":func:`forestploter.read_forest_data` accepts a merge only when it is:"
msgstr ":func:`forestploter.read_forest_data` 仅接受同时满足以下条件的合并："

#: ../../data_contract.rst:398
