#: ../../data_contract.rst:455
msgid "Clipping semantics"
msgstr "截断语义"

#: ../../data_contract.rst:457
msgid ""
"An arrow replaces the vertical cap on every clipped side. An interval "
"spanning both limits shows its visible line and two arrows, with no "
"endpoint caps. An interval entirely left or right of the range shows only"
" the nearest outward arrow and no line, cap, or fabricated marker. "
"``clipped_intervals`` counts affected intervals, so each interval "
"contributes at most one."
msgstr ""
"箭头取代了每个发生截断的竖直端帽。跨越两个限制的区间显示其可见线和两个箭头，没有端点端帽。完全位于范围左侧或右侧的区间仅显示最近的向外箭头，而不显示线条、端帽或伪造的标记。"
" ``clipped_intervals`` 对受影响的区间进行计数，因此每个区间最多贡献 1 个。"

