#: ../../gallery/13_comprehensive_showcase.rst:4
msgid ""
"This synthetic example combines the package's main input and rendering "
"features in one figure. Each outcome is a bold header row containing its "
"shared participant count and note; three programs appear below it as "
"indented child rows. Every child has matching CI text in both the crude "
"and adjusted panels. This workbook deliberately uses no merged cells. "
"Lower- and upper-bound clipping are both visible. Both panels retain the "
"no-effect reference line, while an additional target line appears in the "
"adjusted panel only. Direction labels and both the series and line "
"legends occupy the bottom region."
msgstr ""
"该合成示例在一张图中组合了本包的主要输入与渲染能力。每个结局使用一个加粗标题行，其中填写共享的参与者数量和注释；三个方案以缩进子行列在其下。每个子行在粗模型和校正模型面板中都有对应的"
" CI "
"文本。本工作簿特意不使用合并单元格。图中同时显示下界和上界截断。两个面板都保留无效应参考线，额外目标线只出现在校正模型面板。方向标签、系列图例和线型图例均位于底部区域。"

#: ../../gallery/13_comprehensive_showcase.rst:13
msgid ""
"Rows use compact spacing, and CI text follows the conventional ``0.68 "
"[0.42, 0.92]`` form. Indented child labels, marker styling, and the "
"legend identify each series instead of repeating its name in every CI-"
"text cell."
msgstr ""
"各行采用紧凑间距，CI 文本使用常规的 ``0.68 [0.42, 0.92]`` 格式。缩进子行标签、标记样式和图例共同标识各系列，无需在每个 "
"CI 文本单元格中重复系列名称。"

