#: ../../getting_started.rst:2
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:5
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:7
msgid "Install the current release from PyPI:"
msgstr "从 PyPI 安装当前版本："

#: ../../getting_started.rst:13
msgid ""
"For a release candidate, allow prereleases explicitly with ``python -m "
"pip install --pre forestploter``. Contributors can instead install an "
"editable checkout with ``python -m pip install -e .``."
msgstr ""
"对于候选版本，请使用 ``python -m pip install --pre forestploter`` "
"显式允许预发行版本。贡献者也可以使用 ``python -m pip install -e .`` 安装可编辑的源码检出。"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:17
msgid ""
"XLSX is the recommended input format. Begin with the :download:`long-"
"table workbook template <../tests/data/forest_data_template.xlsx>`. Its "
"first worksheet is ``Forest`` and its ``README`` worksheet contains an "
"English/Chinese field dictionary, entry rules, and validated drop-down "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"XLSX 是推荐的输入格式。请从 :download:`长表工作簿模板 "
"<../tests/data/forest_data_template.xlsx>` 开始。其第一个工作表是 ``Forest``，其 "
"``README`` 工作表包含中英文字段字典、录入规则和带数据验证的下拉字段。"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:23
msgid "Read a file"
msgstr "读取文件"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:31
msgid ""
"Despite the familiar variable name, ``df`` is a "
":class:`forestploter.ForestData` object. Its ``frame`` attribute is the "
"underlying DataFrame, while ``spans`` contains supported XLSX merges. CSV"
" uses the same fields but has no merge metadata:"
msgstr ""
"尽管变量名称很熟悉，但 ``df`` 是一个 :class:`forestploter.ForestData` 对象。它的 ``frame`` "
"属性是底层 DataFrame，而 ``spans`` 包含支持的 XLSX 合并。 CSV 使用相同的字段，但没有合并信息："

#: ../../getting_started.rst:41
msgid "Minimal long table"
msgstr "最小长表"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:43
msgid ""
"Each source record contains at most one ``estimate/lower/upper`` triple. "
"``_plot_row`` determines the visual row, ``_series`` selects the series "
"style, and ``_ci_column`` selects the target CI plotting column."
msgstr ""
"每条源记录最多包含一个 ``estimate/lower/upper`` 三元组。 ``_plot_row`` 确定视觉行，``_series``"
" 选择系列样式，``_ci_column`` 选择目标 CI 绘图列。"

#: ../../getting_started.rst:47
msgid ""
"The physical field order below follows the recommended entry layout: "
"visible fields before the first CI, the statistical triple, visible "
"fields after the CI, and finally the six control fields. The rendered "
"order is controlled only by ``columns``."
msgstr ""
"下面的物理字段顺序遵循推荐的录入布局：第一个 CI 之前的显示字段、统计三元组、CI 之后的显示字段，最后是六个控制字段。渲染顺序仅由 "
"``columns`` 控制。"

