msgstr "XLSX/CSV 长表中的可审计森林图"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid ""
"``forestploter`` places table text, statistical estimates, and confidence"
" intervals in one shared row-and-column geometry. XLSX preserves values, "
"record order, and supported vertical merges; CSV uses the same logical "
"fields. You calculate the statistics, while the package reads, validates,"
" lays out, and renders the figure."
msgstr ""
"``forestploter`` 将表格文本、统计估计和置信区间放置在一个共享的行和列几何图形中。 XLSX 保留值、记录顺序和支持的纵向合并； "
"CSV 使用相同的逻辑字段。您计算统计数据，而包则读取、验证、布置和呈现图形。"

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid "Current capabilities"
msgstr "当前能力"

