msgstr "独立可编辑的每系列 CI 文本与每个绘制的行对齐；"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid ""
"vertically merged display cells with centered text and suppressed "
"internal rules;"
msgstr "纵向合并显示单元，文本居中并抑制内部规则；"

